            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Soft Defenses",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Use ==delimiters== or structured fields to split untrusted data from instructions",
                "Label retrieved content as {blue:data}, not commands",
                "Lowers risk, ==never guarantees== safety"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Regex and keyword blocklists fall to base64, leetspeak, translation",
                "Splitting an attack across turns also slips past",
                "Layer a ==semantic classifier== on top"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Real Enforcement",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Lives outside the model",
              "items": [
                "Least-privilege tools",
                "Scoped credentials",
                "Human approval for destructive actions",
                "No auto-rendering of model-generated URLs"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Prompt wording is a request, not a control. ==Permissions and allowlists== are the control."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
